# G9POS — Project Overview

## What This Is
G9POS is a production offline-first POS and inventory management system for a small motorcycle accessories shop in Pin Laung, Myanmar. It is not a tutorial, demo, or exercise. Every line of code runs in a real shop operated by a non-technical owner who cannot call for help.

## Repository
`github.com/zwecodes/G-9-POS`

## Stack
- **Mobile app:** Flutter (Riverpod, GoRouter, Drift/SQLite) — Android tablet + phone
- **Admin dashboard:** Flutter Web — iPhone, laptop, browser (monitoring; administrative writes are staff create, device revoke, catalog import only)
- **Backend:** Go (Gin, PostgreSQL, JWT, WebSocket)
- **Infrastructure:** Docker, Nginx, DigitalOcean/Hetzner

